  m_Text: 'There are plenty of good deals at the store that''ll get you items of
    a certain rarity OR BETTER. Items can''t be downgraded: if you get an item you
    already had, the better version will be kept and the worse one will be turned
    into scrap.

    

    We also have a FREE chest available every 4 hours (or
    quicker with artifacts!)'
