  m_Text: "Trinkets are special equipment that you can give to your heroes during
    a run. Only one trinket per hero, but each trinket can have up to 3 effects!\r\n\r\nBuying
    a box will get you one brand new shiny trinket! It can have multiple effects,
    but there\u2019s only one trinket in each box.\r\n\r\nTo level a trinket, the
    hero who has it equipped must complete the trinket quest."
